## Technical Details

### Key Classes
1. ModelGUI
   - Main GUI application class
   - Handles user input and model execution
   - Manages result export

2. LiabilityModel
   - Projects insurance contract cash flows
   - Handles multiple types of insurance products
   - Manages actuarial assumptions

3. AssetModel
   - Manages investment portfolio
   - Projects investment cash flows
   - Handles different asset types

4. WholeLifeInsurance
   - Implements whole life insurance functionality
   - Handles premium payments and policy values
   - Manages policy status

### Important Methods
1. run_model()
   - Creates insurance contracts
   - Sets up economic scenarios
   - Projects cash flows
   - Exports results

2. project_cashflows()
   - Projects liability cash flows
   - Handles different time steps
   - Accumulates cash flows across contracts

3. export_to_excel()
   - Exports both liability and investment results
   - Creates formatted Excel workbook
   - Handles multiple result types

